[size=3][u][b]Changelog[/b][/u][/size]

[size=3][u][i][1.02] - 2026-09-08[/i][/u][/size]
[list]
[*] Fixed
[list]
[*] [b]build_gate[/b] ignored a supplied [b]$rotation[/b] and always used the map rotation, even when [b]$getRotationFromMap[/b] was false, thanks to Bamfon for reporting and proposing a fix
[*] A failed gate spawn was reported as a success
[/list]
[*] Changed
[list]
[*] Documented [b]$offset[/b] and [b]$rotation[/b] as plain tables, which is what the API actually accepts
[*] [b]$rotation[/b] is now optional in every case, falling back to the map rotation when it is absent
[/list]
[/list]
